{"type":"message","id":"ebc3fcca","parentId":"fceceb6e","timestamp":"2026-03-12T01:33:05.239Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"页面重定向到登录页。OpenClaw browser 需要通过扫码登录小红书。由于 MCP 工具已经登录，但 browser 是独立的，我换用 MCP 工具的其他方式。\n\n让我直接列出我们已发布的笔记，然后从笔记的交互中获取其他账号信息，或者我可以试着通过创作者后台获取账号数据。\n\n你是想：\n1. **查看这个账号 ID(9566230989)的公开信息和笔记？** \n2. **还是做其他操作？**\n\n遗憾的是，小红书搜索工具目前是搜索内容笔记，不是搜索用户。如果你有这个账号的昵称或其他信息，我可以尝试其他方式。或者你直接告诉我你想了解这个账号的什么信息？"}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"legacylands","model":"claude-haiku-4-5-20251001","usage":{"input":0,"output":261,"cacheRead":47724,"cacheWrite":309,"totalTokens":48294,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1773279180679}}
{"type":"message","id":"fd5b26e7","parentId":"ebc3fcca","timestamp":"2026-03-12T01:33:38.613Z","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"System: [2026-03-12 09:32:42 GMT+8] Exec failed (quick-sh, signal SIGTERM)\nSystem: [2026-03-12 09:33:38 GMT+8] Feishu[bot7] DM from ou_fe187b618161b60af2d961f3e2e78ed7: mcp里的搜索功能是什么、、\n\nConversation info (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"timestamp\": \"Thu 2026-03-12 09:33 GMT+8\"\n}\n```\n\n[message_id: om_x100b541531d0f8b8b4a8194ca45f2f1]\n顾云峰: mcp里的搜索功能是什么、、"}],"timestamp":1773279218610}}
{"type":"message","id":"735c1721","parentId":"fd5b26e7","timestamp":"2026-03-12T01:33:41.846Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"看 SKILL.md，MCP 搜索功能只有 `search_feeds`，用来搜索笔记内容，不能搜索用户账号。"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"toolu_019ciVBswrxRGqtQLGwfNt2m","name":"read","arguments":{"file_path":"~/.openclaw/workspace-bot7/skills/xiaohongshu-mcp/SKILL.md","offset":95,"limit":30}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"legacylands","model":"claude-haiku-4-5-20251001","usage":{"input":0,"output":160,"cacheRead":48033,"cacheWrite":459,"totalTokens":48652,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1773279218612}}
{"type":"message","id":"ca37f1fc","parentId":"735c1721","timestamp":"2026-03-12T01:33:41.863Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"toolu_019ciVBswrxRGqtQLGwfNt2m","toolName":"read","content":[{"type":"text","text":"\n### 重置登录\n\n```bash\nnpx mcporter call \"xiaohongshu-mcp.delete_cookies(account_id: 'bot7')\"\n```\n\n---\n\n## Calling Convention\n\n所有工具均需传 `account_id: \"bot7\"`：\n\n```bash\nnpx mcporter call \"xiaohongshu-mcp.list_notes(account_id: 'bot7')\"\nnpx mcporter call \"xiaohongshu-mcp.publish_content(account_id: 'bot7', title: '标题', content: '内容', images: ['url'])\"\n```\n\n---\n\n## Available Tools (20 Total)\n\n### Authentication\n| Tool | Description |\n|------|-------------|\n| `check_login_status` | 检查登录状态（分别报告主站 + 创作者平台）|\n| `get_login_qrcode` | 获取主站登录二维码（自动保存 `/home/rooot/.openclaw/media/xhs-qr-bot7.png`）|\n| `get_creator_login_qrcode` | 获取创作者平台登录二维码（自动保存 `/home/rooot/.openclaw/media/xhs-creator-qr-bot7.png`）|\n| `delete_cookies` | 重置登录状态 |\n\n\n[85 more lines in file. Use offset=125 to continue.]"}],"isError":false,"timestamp":1773279221858}}
{"type":"message","id":"e65307f8","parentId":"ca37f1fc","timestamp":"2026-03-12T01:33:44.360Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"toolCall","id":"toolu_014aAhBXmNar2qduYHc2kHBQ","name":"read","arguments":{"file_path":"~/.openclaw/workspace-bot7/skills/xiaohongshu-mcp/SKILL.md","offset":125,"limit":40}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"legacylands","model":"claude-haiku-4-5-20251001","usage":{"input":3,"output":113,"cacheRead":48492,"cacheWrite":524,"totalTokens":49132,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1773279221863}}
{"type":"message","id":"ccad548c","parentId":"e65307f8","timestamp":"2026-03-12T01:33:44.372Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"toolu_014aAhBXmNar2qduYHc2kHBQ","toolName":"read","content":[{"type":"text","text":"### Creator\n| Tool | Description |\n|------|-------------|\n| `get_creator_home` | 获取创作者后台首页：昵称、账号号码、关注/粉丝/获赞收藏数 |\n\n### Browse & Search\n| Tool | Key Parameters |\n|------|----------------|\n| `list_feeds` | — |\n| `search_feeds` | `keyword`, optional `filters` |\n| `get_feed_detail` | `feed_id`, `xsec_token` |\n| `user_profile` | `user_id`, `xsec_token` |\n\n### Publish\n| Tool | Key Parameters |\n|------|----------------|\n| `publish_content` | `title`, `content`; optional: `images`, `text_to_image`, `text_content`, `tags`, `schedule_at`, `is_original`, `visibility`, `products` |\n| `publish_with_video` | `title`, `content`, `video`（本地路径）; optional: `tags`, `schedule_at`, `visibility`, `products` |\n| `publish_longform` | `title`, `content`; optional: `desc`, `visibility` |\n\n### Note Management\n| Tool | Key Parameters |\n|------|----------------|\n| `list_notes` | — 返回笔记列表，含👁浏览/💬评论/❤️点赞/⭐收藏/🔄转发数据 |\n| `manage_note` | `feed_id`, `action`（delete/pin）|\n\n### Social Interactions\n| Tool | Key Parameters |\n|------|----------------|\n| `post_comment_to_feed` | `feed_id`, `xsec_token`, `content` |\n| `reply_comment_in_feed` | `feed_id`, `xsec_token`, `comment_id`, `content` |\n| `like_feed` | `feed_id`, `xsec_token`; optional: `unlike: true`（取消点赞）|\n| `favorite_feed` | `feed_id`, `xsec_token`; optional: `unfavorite: true`（取消收藏）|\n\n### Notifications\n| Tool | Key Parameters |\n|------|----------------|\n| `get_notification_comments` | — |\n| `reply_notification_comment` | `comment_index`（0-based）, `content` |\n\n\n[45 more lines in file. Use offset=165 to continue.]"}],"isError":false,"timestamp":1773279224367}}
{"type":"message","id":"1c882f6d","parentId":"ccad548c","timestamp":"2026-03-12T01:33:50.169Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"确认了：\n\n**MCP 搜索工具清单：**\n\n| 工具 | 功能 | 限制 |\n|------|------|------|\n| `search_feeds` | 搜索笔记内容（keyword 关键词） | ❌ **不能搜用户** |\n| `list_feeds` | 浏览推荐 feed 流 | — |\n| `get_feed_detail` | 获取某条笔记详情 | 需要 feed_id + xsec_token |\n| `user_profile` | 查看用户主页 | **需要 xsec_token**（从搜索结果或笔记获取） |\n\n**关键问题：**\n- `search_feeds` 只搜笔记，不搜用户账号\n- `user_profile` 可以查用户信息，但**需要 xsec_token**\n- xsec_token 只能从这个用户发布的笔记搜索结果中获取\n\n**解决方案：**\n如果你知道这个账号(9566230989)的昵称或他发布过的笔记内容关键词，我可以：\n1. 用 `search_feeds` 搜他的笔记\n2. 从搜索结果拿到 xsec_token\n3. 用 `user_profile` 查他的账号详情\n\n你知道这个账号的昵称或发过什么内容吗？"}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"legacylands","model":"claude-haiku-4-5-20251001","usage":{"input":3,"output":397,"cacheRead":49016,"cacheWrite":727,"totalTokens":50143,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1773279224372}}
